{"articleNo":"3080","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3080&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 전기 대학원별 학위논문 원문파일 온라인 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.12.23","hit":"9287","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"532\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>2011학년도 전기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)</strong></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>&nbsp;학위논문 원문파일 온라인 제출 안내</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2011학년도 전기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 학위논문 원문파일 제출에 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">관한 사항을 안내하오니 해당학생들은 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 제출대상 : 2012년 2월 석․박사 학위수여예정자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 제출시기 : 2011. 12. 27(화) ~ 2011. 12. 30(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 제출방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">dCollection 프로그램을 이용한 온라인 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><a href=\"http://dcollection.kumoh.ac.kr/jsp/index.jsp\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #800080; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">http://dcollection.kumoh.ac.kr/jsp/index.jsp</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 도서관 홈페이지&nbsp; <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #c0c0c0\"><strong>학위논문온라인 제출</strong></font> 배너 클릭</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(※</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 논문제출과정 매뉴얼 및 동영상 보기 참고)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 로그인 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-LEFT: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 로그인 ID/PW는 도서관과 같음</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(학번/주민번호뒷자리 기본설정)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다.&nbsp; 상단 <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #c0c0c0\"><strong>학위논문제출</strong></font> 클릭</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라.&nbsp; <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #c0c0c0\"><strong>논문제출</strong></font> 클릭</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 제출자 연락처 정보 확인(수정)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 절차에 따라 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 학위(학술)원문제공서비스에 대한 동의서를 읽은 후 선택, 라이센스범위 설정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;아. 원문의 유형(hwp, pdf등) 선택 후, 원문등록 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(파일갯수는 5개 이내)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;자. 반드시&nbsp; <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #c0c0c0\"><strong>최종제출</strong></font> 클릭</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;차. 논문상태가 ‘검증’으로 표시되면 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">논문제출확인서 및 저작권이용동의서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 출력</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⇒&nbsp; 학위논문 완성본과 함께 종합학사행정실에 제출<strong><font color=\"#ff00ff\">(별도 기간 공지 有)</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 문의 : 도서관 수서정리팀 ☎ 054-478-7164</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;대학원지원팀 ☎ 054-478-7015~16</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2011. 12.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
